    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "Lexeditor now saves the restored window rectangle and maximized state on close or restart, then restores both on the next launch. Saved bounds are clamped to the nearest monitor work area so a display change cannot reopen the app off-screen. The persistence and invalid-state contracts pass; please restart once after maximizing to confirm the visible native window returns maximized.",
